    {
      "target": "새 컴퓨터를 설치하는 데 도와드릴게요.",
      "reading": "Sae keompyuteoreul seolchihaneun de dowadeurilgeyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "I’ll help you install the new computer.",
        "ko": "새 컴퓨터를 설치하는 데 도와드릴게요.",
        "ipa": "Sae keompyuteoreul seolchihaneun de dowadeurilgeyo.",
        "ar": "سأساعدك في إعداد الكمبيوتر الجديد.",
        "cs": "Pomůžu vám nainstalovat nový počítač.",
        "da": "Jeg hjælper dig med at installere den nye computer.",
        "de": "Ich helfe dir, den neuen Computer einzurichten.",
